<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { width: 80%; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Verify Your Email</h2>
        <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
        <p>Thank you for registering with GROW! Please verify your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
        <p>
            <a href="<%= verifyLink %>" class="button">Verify Email</a>
        </p>
        <p>If you did not create an account, no further action is required.</p>
        <p>This link will expire in 24 hours.</p>
        <p>Best regards,<br>The GROW Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
